{
  "id": "reminders_multi_3_1",
  "system_img": "default",
  "instruction": "In the Finder app, locate a PDF file at ~/Documents; then in the Reminders app, create a reminder named after that PDF's filename (without the \".pdf\" extension) that is due next week at 11:00 AM.",
